'''Radical Highway''' (ラジカルハイウェイ, ''Rajikaru Haiwei'', '''Radical Highway''') is a [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event|Sonic the Hedgehog]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 14.4 Update]]. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Shadow (Enemy)|Shadow]].

==Overview==
===About===
Radical Highway contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Chaos Control Lvs'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Chaos Control Lv. can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], and [[Catamin]]s. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Radical Highway/Chaos Control Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Radical Highway is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

